              "metadata": {
                "officialTrackName": "Business",
                "summary": "A business is an asset when it generates cash flow that exceeds its operating costs. This lesson introduces business ownership as the third major asset class alongside real estate and paper assets, and establishes why financial competency in business is essential to building lasting wealth."
              }
